Everyone knows how you think.

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:56.310
Give me a sip.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.450
No indirect kissing!

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:05.110
Hime-chan has a dirty mind.

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:07.500
S-So I have a dirty mind!

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.290
Can you stop that? It's embarrassing.

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:19.110
Gekkou, isn't this fun?

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:20.250
How is this fun?

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:22.620
Because we're with everyone.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:34.620
It's not bad.

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:46.910
I'll need you

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:50.950
to play with the other student council 
president a little longer, Lil.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:09.160
Everything is as the prophecy ordains.

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:16.360
But will the dark rabbit within 
Kurogane Taito awaken before the time comes?

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:21.950
It doesn't matter what you try.

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:25.190
It's too late now.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:30.810
My heart is utterly filled with despair.

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:36.260
But my stupid, foolish, 
and stubborn brother

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:39.570
may be able to find a way.

00:21:47.390 --> 00:21:49.050
Have fun.

00:21:52.850 --> 00:21:56.440
Man, I thought we were finished?

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:59.890
I was going to spend summer 
vacation partying until I puked.

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:01.370
Stupid optimist.

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:02.750
What did you say?!

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:08.060
It's possible that our actions 
have set the gears into motion.

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:12.800
Either way, I have no intention 
of following their script.

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:15.820
Yeah, neither do I.

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.140
You're free to follow 
me, but don't interfere.

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:22.760
If you do...

00:22:22.760 --> 00:22:26.780
If you interfere with 
Gekkou, I'll get mad!

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:29.240
You're the biggest troublemaker here.

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:36.070
Let's finish this before my date.

00:22:36.070 --> 00:22:37.300
Seriously?!

00:22:37.300 --> 00:22:38.780
You move fast!

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:41.710
Honestly...

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:43.450
They're so noisy.

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:45.040
Move faster!

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:51.560
Himea.

00:22:52.840 --> 00:22:53.300
Huh?

00:22:54.620 --> 00:22:57.510
I'm going to become stronger.

00:22:59.910 --> 00:23:01.820
Uh-huh, Taito!
